# The harness proving itself on xclock (x11-apps, in the dev and spike images):
#
#   just spike --label selftest --script scripts/spike/scenarios/selftest.spike -- xclock -update 1
#
# A window arrives, repaints once a second (damage, frames, tiles), takes focus and keys, and is
# snapped. `just spike-selftest` runs this and checks the report.
wait-for toplevel 1 15000
mark idle
wait 3000
snap idle
focus 1
mark typing
type ab
key Return
wait 500
snap typed
stop
